cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its accompanying paper, please cite it as below."
title: "ast-context-narrowing: AST-Based Structural Narrowing for Diff Context"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-22
authors:
  - family-names: Herrador
    given-names: Edgar
repository-code: "https://github.com/eherrador/ast-context-narrowing"
abstract: >-
  A small library that narrows a code diff to the structural definition it
  touched -- a method, function, class, or field -- by walking a Tree-sitter
  AST from the changed byte range upward, instead of using the raw diff hunk
  or the whole file. Supports C#, TypeScript, TSX, and JavaScript.
keywords:
  - ast
  - tree-sitter
  - diff
  - fine-tuning
  - llm
  - code-review
  - dataset-curation
license: MIT
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: "AST-Based Structural Narrowing for Diff Context: A Third Alternative to Raw Hunks and Whole Files"
  authors:
    - family-names: Herrador
      given-names: Edgar
  year: 2026
  url: "https://github.com/eherrador/ast-context-narrowing/blob/main/paper/ast-context-narrowing.md"
